{"step_index":462,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-02T01:10:57Z","thinking":"Row 12000 and 12346 in the Excel file have null employee counts due to an earlier update that only populated the count for a subset of rows. The `bizno_filtered_result.tsv` file contains accurate employee counts for all companies, which allows verification of the data. Checking row 154 of `bizno_filtered_result.tsv` provides the required data for Excel row 12000.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst lines = fs.readFileSync('bizno_filtered_result.tsv', 'utf-8').split('\\n').filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\n\nconsole.log('Row 1 (Excel 11847):', lines[0].split('\\t')[2], '->', lines[0].split('\\t')[11]);\nconsole.log('Row 154 (Excel 12000):', lines[153].split('\\t')[2], '->', lines[153].split('\\t')[11]);\nconsole.log('Row 200 (Excel 12046):', lines[199].split('\\t')[2], '->', lines[199].split('\\t')[11]);\nconsole.log('Row 300 (Excel 12146):', lines[299].split('\\t')[2], '->', lines[299].split('\\t')[11]);\nconsole.log('Row 500 (Excel 12346):', lines[499].split('\\t')[2], '->', lines[499].split('\\t')[11]);\n\"","Cwd":"c:\\Users\\lg\\resilient-bardeen","WaitMsBeforeAsync":2000,"toolAction":"Checking employee counts in tsv","toolSummary":"Check employee counts across 500 rows"}}]}
{"step_index":463,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-02T01:11:00Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-02T10:11:00+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-02T10:11:01+09:00\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\nRow 1 (Excel 11847): 주식회사 룩스텍 -> 2\nRow 154 (Excel 12000): 장산기공 -> 7\nRow 200 (Excel 12046): 밤산책가 -> 1\nRow 300 (Excel 12146): 크로스컨설팅 -> 1\nRow 500 (Excel 12346): 금정산업기계 -> 7\n\n"}
{"step_index":464,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-02T01:11:01Z","thinking":"The Bizno data provides precise employee counts for the specified rows in the Excel file.  I need to develop a script that reads the Excel data, locates the matching rows (11847 to 12346), and updates \"Col 15\" with the corresponding Bizno employee numbers.  The script will ensure that only the correct employee counts from the Bizno data are used for the update.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst ExcelJS = require('exceljs');\n\nasync function updateEmployeesFromBizno() {\n  const filePath = 'C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\lg\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\오늘\\\\\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx';\n  const backupSrc = 'C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\lg\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\오늘\\\\\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명_backup_11847_12346.xlsx';\n  \n  if (!fs.existsSync(filePath)) {\n    console.log('Restoring from backup...');\n    fs.copyFileSync(backupSrc, filePath);\n  }\n  \n  console.log('Reading Bizno 500 rows TSV...');\n  const tsvLines = fs.readFileSync('bizno_filtered_result.tsv', 'utf-8').split('\\n').filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\n  console.log('Total Bizno rows:', tsvLines.length);\n  \n  console.log('Loading workbook...');\n  const workbook = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n  await workbook.xlsx.readFile(filePath);\n  const sheet = workbook.getWorksheet('기업 정보');\n  \n  const orangeFill = {\n    type: 'pattern',\n    pattern: 'solid',\n    fgColor: { argb: 'FFFFA500' } // Standard Orange\n  };\n  \n  let updatedCount = 0;\n  \n  for (let i = 0; i < tsvLines.length; i++) {\n    const rowNum = 11847 + i;\n    const row = sheet.getRow(rowNum);\n    const p = tsvLines[i].split('\\t');\n    \n    // p[11] is employee count from Bizno\n    const rawEmp = p[11] ? p[11].trim() : '';\n    const empNum = rawEmp !== '' && !isNaN(rawEmp) ? Number(rawEmp) : (rawEmp !== '' ? rawEmp : null);\n    \n    const cell = row.getCell(15);\n    cell.value = empNum;\n    \n    if (empNum !== null) {\n      cell.fill = orangeFill;\n      updatedCount++;\n    }\n    \n    row.commit();\n  }\n  \n  console.log('Updated employee count for ' + updatedCount + ' rows.');\n  console.log('Writing file to temporary path...');\n  const tempPath = filePath + '.tmp';\n  await workbook.xlsx.writeFile(tempPath);\n  \n  console.log('Overwriting target file...');\n  if (fs.existsSync(filePath)) {\n    fs.unlinkSync(filePath);\n  }\n  fs.renameSync(tempPath, filePath);\n  \n  console.log('Successfully saved employee counts from Bizno! Final size:', fs.statSync(filePath).size);\n}\n\nupdateEmployeesFromBizno().catch(console.error);\n\"","Cwd":"c:\\Users\\lg\\resilient-bardeen","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Updating employee counts from Bizno","toolSummary":"Apply Bizno employee counts to Excel"}}]}
